libslimbook 1.28.1-3
  - Install slimbookctl setuid root again, as upstream does. Without it,
    slimbookctl run by a normal user (for example by slimbookindicator)
    cannot read the serial number or the TDP, and cannot change settings.

libslimbook 1.28.1-2
  - Add optdepends for the tools used by slimbookctl report: usbutils,
    efibootmgr, libinput-tools, xorg-xinput, dmidecode, pciutils, flatpak,
    networkmanager.
  - Add this changelog.

libslimbook 1.28.1-1
  - Initial release, built from upstream tag 1.28.1.
  - Install helpers in /usr/lib/slimbook instead of /usr/libexec.
  - Install slimbookctl without the setuid bit.
